Installed by npm: three.js (MIT, the three.js authors); N8AO (MIT, N8python);
postprocessing (Zlib, Raoul van Ruschen), which N8AO imports.

Art, all CC0 1.0: the town and castle pieces (public/models/kit-town.glb,
